;s record runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, April to May and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 years. In 2025 the middle got 173% of normal in April to May and 31% in November to December. Grid 20846 had its driest year in 1980 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
